  "title": "· PRADA Clay Grey Mini Carry Handbag ·",
  "original_title": "PRADA 黏土灰色 Carry 迷你手袋",
  "excerpt": "Prada’s Fall/Winter 2026 mini Carry handbag features a compact trapezoidal shape, curved pocket, single handle, and swaying side leather straps for playful movement.",
