      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For the Fall/Winter 2026 collection, PRADA introduces the Carry handbag in a mini size. Its clean, compact trapezoidal structure is paired with a curved pocket, while the single-handle design creates a relaxed, effortless attitude. The standout feature is the leather straps on both sides of the bag that sway gently with each step, adding a sense of rhythm and a playful character.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
