      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Carry mini handbag was released in the PRADA Fall/Winter 2026 collection, designed by co-creative directors Miuccia Prada and Raf Simons. It interprets the concept of elegance in motion—a bag designed to accompany every movement with a natural posture.",
