      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The handbag features an architectural trapezoidal silhouette. Two round metal studs resemble a pair of sparkling eyes, while a \"smile\" flat pocket design becomes a highlight, its curved lines adding approachability. The straps are elegantly tied at the sides, and the flowing leather fringe adds a lively touch.",
