      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The color \"Clay\" draws from industrial clay, presenting a misty matte grey tone that feels restrained and understated, exuding a calm, steady, and elegant temperament.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Enlarge view Click to enlarge for an ultra-clear visual experience",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This handbag is crafted from fine, smooth natural calfskin, and the leather reveals a naturally flowing interplay of light and shadow as the light changes. Tonal stitching and dark grey edge paint outline the silhouette, and the nearly invisible effect makes it appear even more harmonious and refined.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
