    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Single Handle & Detachable Strap ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The designer has given this bag a structured arched single handle, which adds to its sculptural appeal and also makes it easy to carry by hand or in the crook of the arm.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5hy17rw/c387e379a1e78796.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5hy17rw/6a2f079180b4c181.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The detachable and adjustable strap allows the bag to be worn on the shoulder or crossbody. The slender leather strap is exceptionally light and portable, while the kite-shaped gold hook design creates a modern geometric aesthetic.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
