    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· What Fits Inside ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The exterior curved pocket is both beautiful and practical, ideal for holding tickets, tissues, or a phone—flat small items that are easy to grab on the go.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5hy17rw/fb82152ba4fe1cac.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/5hy17rw/6a56b4ad4fc2ce57.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Opening the bag via the magnetic closure reveals a logo-print nylon lining and a leather slip pocket.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
