    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Carry has a vertical, elongated shape, and from the outside, it already feels light and portable. We packed it with a phone, lipstick, notebook, coin purse, earphones, and a travel perfume—small items like these. The bag is named \"Carry,\" which shows that you can easily carry it in any scenario; it's bound to become a perennial staple in your wardrobe.",
